{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e6a4502e-258e-871d-a7ed-6d99c4452e0a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T12:13:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I have a couch I need to get rid of. I want to put it out on the curb, and I need to know how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can go over that. What's the address where it'll be set out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 350 Admiral Kalbfus Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "350 Admiral Kalbfus, okay, that's up in the North End. Is the couch in decent shape or is it torn up, wet, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's just old. Fabric, a little worn. Nothing wet. It's been inside the whole time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:32-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that makes it easier. Bulky items like a couch generally get picked up on your regular trash day, but you usually have to call it in or schedule it first so the crew knows to look for it. I can put that in for you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So when is the next pickup for me? I'm not sure what day it falls on with the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up your street. [pause] Okay, you're on a Wednesday route. Christmas was yesterday, and that was a Thursday, so your Wednesday pickup wasn't affected. Your next one is Wednesday, the thirty-first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:16-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wednesday, okay. Um, the thing is, there's a late bus that runs on Wednesdays and we always forget about it. Sorry, one second. [pause] Ma, é pa Kuarta-fera, ka nu ta pui li. Nu ta pui li nes kuartu di bespa. Okay, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. What do you mean about the bus, is that something blocking the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's just that the bus comes late on Wednesdays and we get distracted and forget it's trash day. So the couch needs to be out the night before, right? Or in the morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best to have it out the night before, Tuesday evening. Crews can start early and if it's not out when they come by, they won't circle back. So put it at the curb Tuesday night, next to your barrels, not blocking the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday night. Okay. Do I have to take the cushions off or anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just leave it as is. If you want, you can tape a note on it that says it's for pickup, that helps the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I've got you down for a bulky item, a couch, at 350 Admiral Kalbfus Road for the Wednesday the thirty-first pickup. Can I get a phone number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0199. Is this the best number, a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:12:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. So just to be sure, Tuesday night at the curb, and pickup is Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Tuesday night out, Wednesday pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:13:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Rosemarie. Take care."
    }
  ],
